@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = change_me_from_env

### Health
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Create a work note
POST {{base}}/v1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"work","title":"OpenShift lab","content":"Test persistent volumes and monitoring","tags":["openshift","lab"]}

### List notes
GET {{base}}/v1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a finance account
POST {{base}}/v1/finance/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Cash","kind":"cash","opening_balance_idr":0}

### Add an expense category
POST {{base}}/v1/finance/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Makan","kind":"expense"}

### Add a money transaction (paste account UUID from response)
POST {{base}}/v1/finance/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: whatsapp-message-id-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"expense","amount_idr":28000,"from_account_id":"REPLACE_ACCOUNT_UUID","description":"Makan siang"}

### Current month report
GET {{base}}/v1/finance/summary

### Create a liability account (credit limit is not an asset or income)
POST {{base}}/v1/finance/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"SPayLater","kind":"paylater","classification":"liability","credit_limit_idr":3000000}

### Record a BNPL purchase: recognized spending and liability, no bank cash movement
POST {{base}}/v1/finance/liability-purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: purchase-shoes-2026-11-02
Content-Type: application/json

{"liability_account_id":"REPLACE_SPAYLATER_UUID","principal_amount_idr":600000,"total_fee_idr":0,"tenor":3,"first_due_date":"2026-12-01","description":"Sepatu"}

### Pay an installment from an asset account (principal repayment, not another expense)
POST {{base}}/v1/finance/installments/REPLACE_INSTALLMENT_UUID/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: repayment-spaylater-2026-12-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"asset_account_id":"REPLACE_BANK_UUID","amount_idr":200000,"description":"Cicilan SPayLater"}

### Upcoming / overdue installment schedule
GET {{base}}/v1/finance/installments?upcoming=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search indexed notes, objects, and photo captions
POST {{base}}/v1/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"OpenShift monitoring","limit":5}
